		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">19</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer.
shirtPrice is of number type, so shirtPrice+shirtPrice will do arithmetic addition. Thus, 499+499 will give 998.
But chocolatePrice is of string type, so chocolatePrice+shirtPrice will do string addition. Thus "20"+499 will give "20499".
Note the use of double quotes for "20" and no double quotes for 499.</attribute>
